---
import Base from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<Base
  title={`Gorillas & Chimpanzees | 7 Day Uganda Primate Safari | Rendile Travels`}
  description={`A 7 day Uganda primate safari, tracking mountain gorillas in Bwindi and chimpanzees in the Kibale forest, private and tailor made. Day by day itinerary and prices from $6,400.`}
  ogTitle={`Gorillas & Chimpanzees | 7 Day Uganda Primate Safari | Rendile Travels`}
  ogDescription={`Mountain gorillas in Bwindi and chimpanzees in Kibale, a private 7 day Uganda journey from $6,400.`}
  ogType={`website`}
  ogImage={`assets/img/ug-bwindi.jpg`}
  canonical={`https://rendiletravels.com/gorillas-and-chimpanzees.html`}
  jsonld={`{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"TouristTrip","name":"Gorillas & Chimpanzees — 7-Day Uganda Primate Safari","description":"A 7-day Uganda primate safari tracking mountain gorillas in Bwindi and chimpanzees in Kibale.","image":"https://rendiletravels.com/assets/img/ug-bwindi.jpg","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Rendile Travels"},"offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":"6400","priceCurrency":"USD"}}`}
  credit={`Imagery via Wikimedia Commons: mountain gorilla © Charles J. Sharp; elephant family &amp; chimpanzee © Giles Laurent; Murchison Falls © NANTUMBWEJ. Licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0" target="_blank" rel="license noopener">CC BY-SA</a>.`}
>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/ug-bwindi.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Uganda · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Gorillas &amp; Chimpanzees</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>7 days</b></span>
        <span>Kibale · Bwindi</span>
        <span>Private &amp; tailor made</span>
        <span>from <b>$6,400</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html?trip=Gorillas%20%26%20Chimpanzees" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="uganda.html">Uganda</a> / Gorillas &amp; Chimpanzees</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">The two great ape encounters of a lifetime in one journey, an hour with a mountain gorilla family in the misty Bwindi forest, and a morning among wild chimpanzees in Kibale, the primate capital of East Africa.</p>
        <p>Private and tailor made, with comfortable lodges and a guide who knows the forests intimately. Gorilla trekking is suitable for reasonably fit travellers aged 15 and over.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your 7 day journey</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Arrive in Entebbe</h3><p>Met at the airport and taken to a tranquil lake shore hotel to rest after your flight and meet your guide.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Entebbe lake hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>To the Kibale forest</h3><p>Fly or drive west to Kibale, through tea estates and crater lake country, arriving at your forest lodge in time for a sundowner.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Kibale forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Chimpanzee trekking</h3><p>A morning tracking habituated chimpanzees through the canopy, hooting calls, drumming on buttress roots, families overhead. An afternoon Bigodi wetland walk for monkeys and birds.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Kibale forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>South to Bwindi</h3><p>A scenic drive south through Queen Elizabeth's plains and the terraced hills to the edge of the Bwindi Impenetrable Forest.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Bwindi forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 5</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Gorilla trekking in Bwindi</h3><p>The day you came for. With trackers ahead, you hike into the ancient forest to spend a magical, regulated hour with a mountain gorilla family, silverback, mothers and tumbling youngsters.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Bwindi forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 6</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Bwindi at leisure</h3><p>A gentler day, a Batwa cultural experience or community walk, or a second gorilla permit for those who can't get enough. Time to simply soak up the forest.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Bwindi forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 7</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly to Entebbe &amp; depart</h3><p>A light aircraft flight back to Entebbe for your onward connection, with the forest still in your ears.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Where you'll stay</p><h2 class="section__title">Lodges</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Gorillas%20%26%20Chimpanzees"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-view.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Kyaninga Lodge</h3><p>Hand built timber lodge above a crater lake near Kibale.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Gorillas%20%26%20Chimpanzees"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-tent.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Bwindi Lodge</h3><p>Forest edge cottages looking onto gorilla country.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Gorillas%20%26%20Chimpanzees"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-suite.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Clouds Mountain Lodge</h3><p>Stone suites high in the Virunga foothills.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="incl reveal">
        <div class="section__head section__head--left"><p class="eyebrow">All taken care of</p><h2 class="section__title">What's included</h2></div>
        <ul class="incl__grid">
          <li>All internal flights &amp; private transfers</li>
          <li>Hand picked forest lodges</li>
          <li>One gorilla permit &amp; one chimpanzee permit</li>
          <li>Expert driver guide &amp; park ranger fees</li>
          <li>All meals as shown</li>
          <li>Bigodi wetland &amp; community walks</li>
          <li>Drinking water in the vehicle</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge &amp; all gratuities</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$6,400 per person sharing</strong>; single supplement available. International flights, visas and a second gorilla permit are extra. Trekking is best in the drier months (June to September &amp; December to February); minimum age 15 for gorillas and chimps.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container reveal"><h2>Meet the great apes.</h2><p>Tell us your dates and we'll secure your gorilla permit, they're limited and sell out early.</p><a href="contact.html?trip=Gorillas%20%26%20Chimpanzees" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">More journeys</p><h2 class="section__title">Other Uganda itineraries</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="classic-uganda-safari.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/ug-qenp.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Classic Uganda Safari</h3><p>10 days · Murchison, Queen Elizabeth &amp; Bwindi.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="primates-and-big-game.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/ug-kibale.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Primates &amp; Big Game</h3><p>8 days · chimps, lions &amp; gorillas.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="uganda.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/ug-murchison.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>All Uganda itineraries</h3><p>Browse every Uganda journey.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
